# ImageIO_DifferenceListDoc (spec 048, T057, FR-012): the ids in tests/unit/imageio/differences.txt and in
# DEVNOTES_DETAILS/IMAGE_IO.md are the same set. A cmake -P script, no git.
#
#   cmake -DDATA=<differences.txt> -DDOC=<IMAGE_IO.md> -P check_difference_list_doc.cmake
foreach(var DATA DOC)
    if(NOT ${var})
        message(FATAL_ERROR "ImageIO_DifferenceListDoc: pass -D${var}=...")
    endif()
endforeach()
if(NOT EXISTS "${DATA}")
    message(FATAL_ERROR "ImageIO_DifferenceListDoc: ${DATA} does not exist")
endif()
if(NOT EXISTS "${DOC}")
    message(FATAL_ERROR "ImageIO_DifferenceListDoc: ${DOC} does not exist (the difference list is rendered there)")
endif()

file(STRINGS "${DATA}" data_lines REGEX "^D-[A-Z0-9]+-[A-Z0-9]+ \\|")
set(data_ids "")
foreach(line IN LISTS data_lines)
    string(REGEX MATCH "^D-[A-Z0-9]+-[A-Z0-9]+" id "${line}")
    list(APPEND data_ids "${id}")
endforeach()
file(READ "${DOC}" doc_text)
string(REGEX MATCHALL "D-[A-Z0-9]+-[A-Z0-9]+" doc_ids "${doc_text}")
list(REMOVE_DUPLICATES doc_ids)
list(SORT data_ids)
list(SORT doc_ids)

set(failures 0)
foreach(id IN LISTS data_ids)
    if(NOT id IN_LIST doc_ids)
        message(STATUS "FAIL: ${id} is in differences.txt but not in IMAGE_IO.md")
        math(EXPR failures "${failures}+1")
    endif()
endforeach()
foreach(id IN LISTS doc_ids)
    if(NOT id IN_LIST data_ids)
        message(STATUS "FAIL: ${id} is in IMAGE_IO.md but not in differences.txt")
        math(EXPR failures "${failures}+1")
    endif()
endforeach()
list(LENGTH data_ids n)
if(n EQUAL 0)
    message(STATUS "FAIL: differences.txt holds no entry")
    math(EXPR failures "${failures}+1")
endif()
if(failures GREATER 0)
    message(FATAL_ERROR "ImageIO_DifferenceListDoc: ${failures} id(s) disagree")
endif()
message(STATUS "ImageIO_DifferenceListDoc: ${n} ids, the data file and the doc agree")
